{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through a branching skill tree and uncover the secrets of the glade. Collect items and refine them into powerful magical resources. Use these to build your own productive and customizable base. You can farm crops, slay monsters and automate your alchemical production.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868320/extras/19736334843a0446ec01237430b9398f.avif?t=1772413459\" width=1200 height=280 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COLLECT AND MANAGE RESOURCES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forage items from the woods with the power of your mighty cursor. Craft these into ingredients for buildings and incremental upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868320/extras/a6fbe64bf7ad00b5d852e230b83124a9.poster.avif?t=1772413459\" width=1170 height=329 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868320/extras/a6fbe64bf7ad00b5d852e230b83124a9.webm?t=1772413459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNLOCK AN INCREMENTAL SKILL TREE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and progress through an incremental skill tree which changes how you play. Pick the best options and become an all-powerful wizard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868320/extras/ca1b46543a7b4c3fe3b0fe7e44cd7ac1.poster.avif?t=1772413459\" width=1170 height=329 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868320/extras/ca1b46543a7b4c3fe3b0fe7e44cd7ac1.webm?t=1772413459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD A PRODUCTIVE BASE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build farmlands, chaotic brewing wells, self-chopping trees and elemental distilleries. Organize your base to preference your comfort or to maximize your productive output.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868320/extras/3992390e89f24d6382c6b560d897ef6d.poster.avif?t=1772413459\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868320/extras/3992390e89f24d6382c6b560d897ef6d.webm?t=1772413459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feature List</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build structures to refine, store and generate items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete a bespoke incremental experience with constant, clear progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do alchemy. Refine ores into ingots. Craft chaos from the elements.  Concoct and harness the world's primordial matter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect in Clicker game style. Chop wood, mine rocks, harvest wheat! You can even prong primordial cubes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access the blueprints shop to unlock new buildings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farm monsters and grow crops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade resources for gold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover hidden locations deep within the woods.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3868320?t=1772413459","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3868320?t=1772413459","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868320/85a2aca88be2aa09bc0c5046be7144a6eb2eb1b0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772413459","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868320/85a2aca88be2aa09bc0c5046be7144a6eb2eb1b0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772413459","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4189140,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Next Fest Automation Demo</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868320/extras/299c665554948a983aaaefe48de40f55.avif?t=1772413459\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868320/extras_big/299c665554948a983aaaefe48de40f55.webp?t=1772413459 width=1560 height=449 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through a branching skill tree and uncover the secrets of the glade. Collect items and refine them into powerful magical resources. Use these to build your own productive and customizable base. You can farm crops, slay monsters and automate your alchemical production.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868320/extras/19736334843a0446ec01237430b9398f.avif?t=1772413459\" width=1200 height=280 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COLLECT AND MANAGE RESOURCES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forage items from the woods with the power of your mighty cursor. Craft these into ingredients for buildings and incremental upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868320/extras/a6fbe64bf7ad00b5d852e230b83124a9.poster.avif?t=1772413459\" width=1170 height=329 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868320/extras/a6fbe64bf7ad00b5d852e230b83124a9.webm?t=1772413459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNLOCK AN INCREMENTAL SKILL TREE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and progress through an incremental skill tree which changes how you play. Pick the best options and become an all-powerful wizard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868320/extras/ca1b46543a7b4c3fe3b0fe7e44cd7ac1.poster.avif?t=1772413459\" width=1170 height=329 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868320/extras/ca1b46543a7b4c3fe3b0fe7e44cd7ac1.webm?t=1772413459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD A PRODUCTIVE BASE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build farmlands, chaotic brewing wells, self-chopping trees and elemental distilleries. Organize your base to preference your comfort or to maximize your productive output.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868320/extras/3992390e89f24d6382c6b560d897ef6d.poster.avif?t=1772413459\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868320/extras/3992390e89f24d6382c6b560d897ef6d.webm?t=1772413459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feature List</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build structures to refine, store and generate items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete a bespoke incremental experience with constant, clear progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do alchemy. Refine ores into ingots. Craft chaos from the elements.  Concoct and harness the world's primordial matter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect in Clicker game style. Chop wood, mine rocks, harvest wheat! You can even prong primordial cubes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access the blueprints shop to unlock new buildings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farm monsters and grow crops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade resources for gold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover hidden locations deep within the woods.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Lost Maxim"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868320/8f99ecbe393a3a5c2044f85b9cce8e5bc2fa8a75/header.jpg?t=1772413459","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br